 because of work. Bill is trying to help Stanley with the Lidem project, but Alison is missing and Stanley has to do the analysis of tasks.\nDialogue:  Rachel: I am so excited to go to the beach tomorrow\r\nLiam: I am too, I have been waiting for this for weeks\r\nRachel: I know, me too. I have been counting down the days\r\nLiam: We should go early, so we can get a good spot\r\nRachel: That's a great idea."}
