s ignored them. Kirsten will try to get a menorah for the lobby next year.\nDialogue: Rachel: I'm so glad you're here, I was worried you'd forget\r\nLiam: I wouldn't forget, I'm not that bad\r\nRachel: I know, I just get a little anxious sometimes\r\nLiam: I'm here now, so don't worry\r\nRachel"}
